292
00:24:40,884 --> 00:24:43,180
Easy, easy, easy.

293
00:24:43,180 --> 00:24:44,968
Come on, bro. Let's go upstairs.

294
00:24:44,968 --> 00:24:46,849
Careful, bro. Watch your step.

295
00:24:46,849 --> 00:24:49,012
Oh, boy!

296
00:24:49,012 --> 00:24:51,416
Bro, why are you so drunk?

297
00:24:51,416 --> 00:24:53,260
Come on, okay.

298
00:24:53,260 --> 00:24:55,272
Careful on the stairs, bro. Watch the stairs.

299
00:24:55,272 --> 00:24:57,416
Okay, bro, now let's enter the code.

300
00:24:57,416 --> 00:24:58,649
Okay, what's the passcode?

301
