Okay, okay. It's done.

303
00:25:04,436 --> 00:25:05,620
Let's go in. Come on.

304
00:25:05,620 --> 00:25:06,852
Oh, boy, oh, boy.

305
00:25:06,852 --> 00:25:09,383
You really had a lot to drink tonight.

306
00:25:57,428 --> 00:25:59,128
