310
00:26:16,964 --> 00:26:20,312
He got really drunk, so I brought him home.

311
00:26:20,312 --> 00:26:22,452
But he said, well... what was it, well...

312
00:26:22,452 --> 00:26:24,900
Oh, he said the hangover cure is here,
so I was looking for it,

313
00:26:24,900 --> 00:26:26,316
but I couldn't find it anywhere.

314
00:26:26,316 --> 00:26:28,128
Where is it?

315
00:26:28,128 --> 00:26:30,149
Not there.

316
00:26:31,360 --> 00:26:33,383
Oh, so it's not here.

317
00:26:35,284 --> 00:26:39,249
No wonder I couldn't find it anywhere.

318
00:26:40,716 --> 00:26:43,848
Then you can take care of him for me, right?

319
00:26:43,848 --> 00:26:45,948
I have to get going.

320
00:26:45,948 --> 00:26:47,648
Okay? Good.

321
00:26:48,516 --> 00:26:51,200
I'll come by another time then, yeah.

322
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:52,949
Oh, you're such a pretty girl.

323
00:27:11,049 --> 00:27:12,483
[Na Sol: Starting today,
I'll dig into your husband's lawyer]

324
00:27:12,483 --> 00:27:14,496
[There's a lot of shady stuff
surrounding your husband's lawyer]

325
